    910  fcaf							; --- No ball in this room → BE the ball gate off. ---------------------
    911  fcaf							; BandTab is the per-band ENABL gate for the cave (.Row). MetaA bit0 is
    912  fcaf							; the band-0 gate AND (for a door) the "M1 strip on the RIGHT half"
    913  fcaf							; flag — a door has no ball, so its bit0 must NOT enable one. Before
